{"title":"Arctic Hare","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1232.9px,824.5px)\"><i style=\"left:1232.9px;top:-824.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1350.4px;top:-770.8px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -152, -1048 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around -70, -1052 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"arctic-hare\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wildlife: <a href=\"#/monster/seagull\">Seagull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rabbit\">Rabbit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chicken\">Chicken</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frog\">Frog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/crab\">Crab</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/deer\">Deer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sheep\">Sheep</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/snow-fox\">Snow Fox</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/harbor-seal\">Harbor Seal</a> <span class=\"muted\">(3)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-black\">Black Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/